n"><svg class="SPi SPi-copyright SP-Asset__copyright__icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#SPi-copyright"></use></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li class="SP-Masonry__item"><div data-sp-card="{}" class="SP-Card SP-Cards__item"><a rel="bookmark" class="SP-CardTeaser-hasFeatureIcons SP-CardTeaser SP-CardTeaser--illustrated" href="/tourismus/sehenswuerdigkeiten/zoo-wilhelma"><!--googleoff: index--><article class="SP-CardTeaser__inner"><figure class="SP-Asset SP-CardTeaser__image SP-FixedSize" id="h36ee6ad-1e93-4429-810f-5570e4fba680"><div class="SP-FixedSize__raiser SP-FixedSize__raiser--3x4"><div class="SPu-lazyload" data-noscript><noscript><picture><source media="(min-width: 75rem)" srcset="/tourismus/sehenswuerdigkeiten/zoo-wilhelma.php.media/185080/Wilhelma-c-Thomas-Wagner-LHS.jpg.scaled/cb4f7cae289b26bb5864868b9537a17a.jpg"/><source media="(min-width: 61.5rem)" srcset="/tourismus/sehenswuerdigkeiten/zoo-wilhelma.php.media/185080/Wilhelma-c-Thomas-Wagner-LHS.jpg.scaled/bf231a5f503800514f20816e6b2092fc.jpg"/><source media="(min-width: 48rem)" srcset="/tourismus/sehenswuerdigkeiten/zoo-wilhelma.php.media/185080/Wilhelma-c-Thomas-Wagner-LHS.jpg.scaled/cb4f7cae289b26bb5864868b9537a17a.jpg"/><source media="(min-width: 34rem)" srcset="/tourismus/sehenswuerdigkeiten/zoo-wilhelma.php.media/185080/Wilhelma-c-Thomas-Wagner-LHS.jpg.scaled/bf231a5f503800514f20816e6b2092fc.jpg"/><source media="(min-width: 27rem)" srcset="/tourismus/sehenswuerdigkeiten/zoo-wilhelma.php.media/185080/Wilhelma-c-Thomas-Wagner-LHS.jpg.scaled/bd18c275ab2546261ab81868dca9dfd0.jpg"/><source media="(min-width: 20rem)" srcset="/tourismus/sehenswuerdigkeiten/zoo-wilhelma.php.media/185080/Wilhelma-c-Thomas-Wagner-LHS.jpg.scaled/8aa6e2e2b107367a92d8405adbebb4e2.jpg"/><source srcset="/tourismus/sehenswuerdigkeiten/zoo-wilhelma.php.media/185080/Wilhelma-c-Thomas-Wagner-LHS.jpg.scaled/a7a09306deef44ed091be0c7ab8ea89a.jpg"/><img data-sp-object-fit class="SP-FixedSize__